                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为确保新学期各项工作高效有序开展，8月24日，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中教育集团</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">召开2025学年新学期工作会议。会议全面总结了上一学年取得的成绩，分析了当前面临的机遇与挑战，并就新学年重点工作进行了全面部署。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">市教育局党委副书记、绍兴一中</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党委书记丁</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">初效</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">出席会议并讲话，校党委副书记、校长蒋明</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">主持会议</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，副校长杨佩琼、朱水军、冯王亮，市教育局专职督学任联君，龙山书院管委会主任裘东等领导</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">分别进行发言</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">中层干部及全体教职工分阶段参会。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">01 教工大会：振奋精神 凝聚共识</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">上午召开的全体教工大会上，校领导简要回顾了2024学年学校在高考升学、学科竞赛、拔尖创新人才培养、龙山书院建设等方面取得的显著成绩，并对新加盟的教师表示热烈欢迎。会议号召全体教职工归零再出发，以昂扬的斗志和务实的作风，共同投身学校高质量发展新征程。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">02 行政会议：交流谋划 精准发力</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">下午</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">召开的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">开学行政工作</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">会议上，学校各处室负责人立足部门职能，围绕新学年工作思路、重点任务和创新举措进行了深入交流。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党政办、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">德育处、教</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">处、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教科室、信息处（求真发展中心）、总务处、安全处、团委、工会、各</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年级管委会</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">以及龙山书院管委会</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">等部门负责人</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">就</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人事管理、教学提质</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、德育创新、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">服务保障、家校沟通、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年级重点工作等谈了具体计划和落实方案，展现了务实高效、主动谋事的工作风貌。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">03 </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">工作部署</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">总结提升</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> 明晰方向</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各分管校领导对处室交流情况进行了精准点评，并就分管领域工作进行了详细部署，要求各部门：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.58in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">聚焦质量提升，在教学教研上求突破；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.58in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">聚焦立德树人，在德育实效上下功夫；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.58in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">聚焦精细规范，在管理保障上提能级；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.58in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">聚焦队伍建设，在教师发展上筑根基。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">蒋明总结</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">点评</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">了学校上半年取得的工作亮点</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，并</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">围绕教学质量、德育实效、管理保障和教师发展四大核心领域，对新学年工作进行了全面部署，要求各部门聚焦主业、清单推进、闭环管理，确保各项工作目标明确、执行有力、成效可见，推动学校发展再上新台阶。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">04 书记讲话：</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">向美而行 成就彼此</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">丁初效</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">总结讲话，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">充分肯定了上一学年的办学成果和各部门新学年的工作规划，并围绕“三对关系”和“四个问题”作了深入浅出的阐述，引发全体教职工对教育本质和学校发展的深度思考。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他指出，教育是“向美而行的遇见”，核心在于“育”，即</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">把</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学生的内心引导出来，帮助其成为最好的自己。他要求全体一中人，尤其是年轻教师，要常反思、有使命、懂坚持，做到“善于筑梦、勇于追梦、勤于圆梦”。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">他</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">强调，面对新学年的机遇与挑战，全体教职工要提振精气神、强化执行力，以“做事精细、做人精神”的标准，共同成就事业和人生的精彩，奋力谱写</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中教育集团</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高质量发展新篇章。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本次会议既是一次总结梳理、谋划部署的工作会，更是一次统一思想、凝聚共识的动员会。新学期，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中教育集团</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全体教职工必将以此次会议为起点，强担当、聚合力、务实干，共同推动学校各项事业再上新台阶！</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843462899.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843462899.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843264373.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843264373.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843288537.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843288537.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843295309.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843295309.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843296764.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843296764.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843304706.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843304706.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843330222.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843330222.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843322174.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843322174.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843349186.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843349186.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843360351.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843360351.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843361422.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843361422.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843377264.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843377264.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843410243.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843410243.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843397666.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843397666.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843401386.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843401386.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843426226.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843426226.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843444472.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843444472.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843442083.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843442083.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2025/8/202508300843455331.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202508300843455331.jpg" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;">
</p>
    
